    "Temperature 0 (gpt-6-luna: default, it accepts no other), one run each. Answers cut off by the token limit were re-run at 32k. Models on Hyperbolic, except gpt-6-luna, grok-4.1-fast and Phi-4-mini on Azure AI Foundry, and gpt-oss-20b and Qwen3.8-27B self-hosted with vLLM on one RTX 4090. Run 2026-11-19."
   ],
   "caveats": [
    "TRACE sessions are synthetic: Claude Opus 4.5 was told to write them; three engineers checked them (\u03ba 0.82).",
    "Only 56 positives, so TPR carries about \u00b17 to \u00b110 points of uncertainty.",
    "judgeval was not run: its AI judges run only on Judgment Labs' cloud. pytest and coverage-py need runnable code, which TRACE doesn't have.",
    "giskard escapes shell text (&& becomes &amp;&amp;), which Hyperbolic's firewall blocks; our relay undoes that escaping for giskard only. One session (0076) is blocked for every tool and is left out (it is not in the scored groups)."
